        560,
        300
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 1,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Marigold V2 Tiled See-through Depth - Vathography\n\nThe see-through model estimates the depth behind glass (windows, windshields, glass roofs) instead of stopping at the glass.\n\nLoad a photograph in the **Photo** node, then run. The depth map (0 to 1, near = bright, far = dark) is saved as a 32-bit EXR with the linear color space.\n\nThe **Marigold V2 See-through Loader** loads the 4-bit backbone and the see-through LoRA together: do not add a LoRA loader.\n\n**Model source:** [Vathography/marigold-v2-see-through-comfyui](https://huggingface.co/Vathography/marigold-v2-see-through-comfyui) (converted from Marigold V2, Apache-2.0). Conditioning: [Comfy-Org/marigold-v2-0](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/marigold-v2-0)\n\nModels are placed in these directories, inside `ComfyUI/models/`:\n\n- diffusion_models/marigold_v2_see_through_qwen_image_edit_2509_nf4.safetensors\n- loras/marigold_v2_depth_see_through.safetensors\n- vae/marigold_v2_depth_see_through_vae.safetensors\n- embeddings/marigold_v2_depth_conditioning.safetensors\n\nLicense: AGPL-3.0-only. The \"Marigold V2 Tiled Depth - Vathography\" nodes have been released for free, and the depth maps they produce are free to use for commercial work.\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "## Marigold V2 Tiled See-through Depth - Vathography\n\nThe see-through model estimates the depth behind glass (windows, windshields, glass roofs) instead of stopping at the glass.\n\nLoad a photograph in the **Photo** node, then run. The depth map (0 to 1, near = bright, far = dark) is saved as a 32-bit EXR with the linear color space.\n\nThe **Marigold V2 See-through Loader** loads the 4-bit backbone and the see-through LoRA together: do not add a LoRA loader.\n\n**Model source:** [Vathography/marigold-v2-see-through-comfyui](https://huggingface.co/Vathography/marigold-v2-see-through-comfyui) (converted from Marigold V2, Apache-2.0). Conditioning: [Comfy-Org/marigold-v2-0](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/marigold-v2-0)\n\nModels are placed in these directories, inside `ComfyUI/models/`:\n\n- diffusion_models/marigold_v2_see_through_qwen_image_edit_2509_nf4.safetensors\n- loras/marigold_v2_depth_see_through.safetensors\n- vae/marigold_v2_depth_see_through_vae.safetensors\n- embeddings/marigold_v2_depth_conditioning.safetensors\n\nLicense: AGPL-3.0-only. The \"Marigold V2 Tiled Depth - Vathography\" nodes have been released for free, and the depth maps they produce are free to use for commercial work.\n"
      },
      "color": "#2a363b",
      "bgcolor": "#3f5159"
    },
